title: The Discipline Question
subtitle: Calm the factions, or let the party breathe and argue.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
frequency: 120
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_party_discipline_timer <= 0 and (internal_dissent >= 22 or barons_dissent >= 12 or spring_dissent >= 12 or labor_dissent >= 12 or progressives_dissent >= 12 or razem_dissent >= 12 or social_patriot_dissent >= 12)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_party_discipline_timer = 3
card-image: img/poland/cards/party-affairs.webp

= The Discipline Question

The party is no longer only a machine for winning votes. It is also a field of
competing moods. The leadership can try to tighten the line, bargain with the
angriest current, or open the room enough for people to say what they think.

- @discipline
- @free_speech
- @concede_barons
- @concede_spring
- @concede_labor
- @concede_progressives
- @concede_razem
- @concede_social_patriot

@discipline
title: Enforce discipline and shut down the leak
subtitle: Party unity rises, but the most aggrieved factions feel pressed.
on-arrival: internal_dissent -= 4; party_unity += 2; barons_dissent += 2; spring_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; social_patriot_dissent += 2; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "The leadership orders a tighter party line"

The whip is restored. Meetings become calmer, speeches become less frank, and
some members decide they are being managed rather than represented.

- #poland_card_finish

@free_speech
title: Permit free speech for a month
subtitle: Dissent falls, but the party becomes less coherent.
on-arrival: internal_dissent -= 6; party_unity -= 2; barons_dissent -= 3; spring_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent -= 3; progressives_dissent -= 3; razem_dissent -= 3; social_patriot_dissent -= 3; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "The party allows a noisy but useful month of argument"

The room becomes louder and less disciplined. The activists feel heard, and the
party's public mood softens even while its sense of direction fades.

- #poland_card_finish

@concede_barons
view-if: barons_dissent >= 12
title: Concede to the Barons
subtitle: Ease the Barons' grievance; the other factions feel patronised.
on-arrival: barons_dissent -= 8; spring_dissent += 3; labor_dissent += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; social_patriot_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; internal_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The leadership placates the Barons and angers the rest"

The Barons hear a clear signal that their concerns matter. The price is that the
rest of the party sees the leadership choose a faction over the common line.

- #poland_card_finish

@concede_spring
view-if: spring_dissent >= 12
title: Concede to the Spring current
subtitle: Give the Spring current room; the other wings feel crowded out.
on-arrival: spring_dissent -= 8; barons_dissent += 3; labor_dissent += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; social_patriot_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; internal_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Spring gets a public concession and the room hardens around it"

A compromise is offered to those who think the party is too managerial and too
slow. Other factions treat it as proof that the centre is tilting away from
them.

- #poland_card_finish

@concede_labor
view-if: labor_dissent >= 12
title: Concede to labour activists
subtitle: Labour gets a visible win; the conservative and liberal wings grow colder.
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 8; barons_dissent += 3; spring_dissent += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; social_patriot_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; internal_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Labour wins a visible concession and the other currents tighten up"

The movement is told that working-class priorities come first. That is good for
some members and a provocation for others.

- #poland_card_finish

@concede_progressives
view-if: progressives_dissent >= 12
title: Concede to the progressives
subtitle: The Left's strongest moral voice gets breathing room; the rest react badly.
on-arrival: progressives_dissent -= 8; barons_dissent += 3; spring_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; social_patriot_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; internal_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The leadership gives the progressives a public concession"

The progressives hear that equality, rights and secular governance will be part
of the party's public line. The other currents hear something like surrender.

- #poland_card_finish

@concede_razem
view-if: razem_dissent >= 12
title: Concede to Razem
subtitle: The movement's younger activists get a signal; the older wings become wary.
on-arrival: razem_dissent -= 8; barons_dissent += 3; spring_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; social_patriot_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; internal_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Razem gains an internal concession and the rest take notice"

The younger and more ambitious members hear that their concerns are not being
ignored. Everybody else hears that the party has chosen one faction's language.

- #poland_card_finish

@concede_social_patriot
view-if: social_patriot_dissent >= 12
title: Concede to the social-patriots
subtitle: The nationalist-social wing gets a public hearing; the left-liberal wings resent it.
on-arrival: social_patriot_dissent -= 8; barons_dissent += 3; spring_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; party_unity -= 1; internal_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "The party gives the social-patriots a concession"

The party makes room for a more national and social language. Some members see
this as common sense. Others see it as a surrender to the mood that wrecks the
alliance.

- #poland_card_finish
